        <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.15 }}>一份可直接审阅的咨询台全文</Text>

        <Box style={{ width: 72, height: 4, background: '#276FBF' }} />

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.7, width: 900 }}>阅读全文前先跟踪一个真实请求 ID：对象本轮提交回复，来访者下一轮才能据实际接收继续行动。</Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 6 }}>
